Torporclast
Ingredients: PROGRESSIVE METAL + INDUSTRIAL TECHNO & SCHRANZ + HAUNTING, SPOOKY & GHOSTLY + Electric Piano  
Creative Catalyst: Its rhythms mimic the heartbeat patterns of hibernating arctic animals.

Torporclast is the sound of an adrenaline-soaked panic attack frozen mid-air at seventy below zero. Hyper-distorted, saturated Schranz kicks and convoluted, odd-meter progressive metal riffs run at a crushing 165 BPM before violently decelerating into protracted, suffocating cardiac lulls of four to twelve beats per minute. In these vast, hypothermic cavities of silence, solitary Fender Rhodes electric piano chords ring out like brittle icicles, drenched in spectral tape-decay and shuddering with sub-bass groans, capturing the eerie suspended animation of a dying metabolism.

